# The code keypad on Hello's Pick a level, a code with digits to fill in
# (3300075C+00??): A on its greyed row opens the keypad with the code in,
# the stand-ins marked and the caret on the first (1); 1 and F typed over
# them, the code reads (2).
#! settings 28=1
# The tests' hook: lists open on their first row (else a list opens on
# Hello, the game Recent played last)
